Package: wbkernel
Type: Package
Title: Single-Pass FAO-56/AquaCrop Soil-Water-Balance Kernel
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Atlas", "Pipeline", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "p.steward@cgiar.org")
Description: Rcpp single-pass daily FAO-56 root-zone soil-water-balance kernel
    (wb_kernel_cpp) for the NDWS (drought) and NDWL0/NDWL50 (waterlogging) hazard
    indices. Per cell, marches days carrying soil water relative to field capacity,
    returning the FAO-56 water-stress coefficient Ks (Allen et al. 1998 Ch.8;
    Pereira et al. 2026) and the AquaCrop aeration-stress coefficient Ks_aer (Raes
    et al. 2009) plus waterlogged-day occurrence and the final state (next-month
    seed). Replaces the legacy eabyep heuristic. Packaged so parallel (future)
    workers load it via library() (no sourceCpp-into-shared-env), like trendkernel.
